  "description": "零相依的 .NET MVVM 基礎設施:ObservableObject(INotifyPropertyChanged / INotifyPropertyChanging、SetProperty 可帶自訂比較器、相依屬性通知)、RelayCommand / RelayCommand<T>(參數型別不符時明確拒絕,不做隱含轉型)、AsyncRelayCommand / AsyncRelayCommand<T>(預設不重入以防連點重複送出、支援取消、例外記錄於 LastException 而非被 async void 吞掉或炸掉程式)。CanExecuteChanged 會回到建構時擷取的 SynchronizationContext 觸發。只依賴 BCL 的 System.Windows.Input.ICommand,不引用 WPF。Zero-dependency MVVM building blocks for .NET: ObservableObject, RelayCommand and RelayCommand<T> with explicit parameter type checks, and AsyncRelayCommand with non-reentrant execution by default, cancellation, and exceptions recorded instead of lost to async void. Built on the BCL ICommand only; no WPF reference.",
